<p style="text-align: center;">Field Study: Discovery Park 050316. 8x10, oil on linen panel. 2016</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">And then there are difficult days! Today I decided to take my sketch marathon outdoors. I started a different painting three times (scraping it off after each attempt), before turning around and painting a different view. I was finally able to take this one to completion.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="line-height: 1.42857;">I got lucky with this one.&nbsp;</span>Painting outside at this time of year is difficult - my first few attempts at capturing spring greenery usually end in failure. It gets easier over the the course of the summer as the greens become less bright.</p>